WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Choose 3 or 4 tokens each. Connect 3 to win.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Player 1 places on an empty point.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Player 2 replies. Alternate every turn.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Player 1 places another coin.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Player 2 places. One coin per point.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Player 1 places a third coin.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Player 2 places a third coin.

8
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Player 1 places its fourth coin.

9
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Player 2 places the last coin. Time to slide.

10
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Select Player 1 at bottom-middle.

11
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Slide along the line into the centre.

12
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Player 1 wins on the diagonal!

